<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">imi wa nai no sa</font></b></font></font></font>

35
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">there will be no meaning</font></b></font></font></font>

36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:38,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ugh... what are you here for now?</font>

39
00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:43,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's our reunion after so long,
and you're awfully cold.</font>

40
00:01:44,660 --> 00:01:48,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me that you came to
assassinate Hokage-sama?</font>

41
00:01:48,290 --> 00:01:49,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, no...</font>

42
00:01:50,340 --> 00:01:52,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have enough
subordinates for that yet...</font>

43
00:01:53,090 --> 00:01:55,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've heard of the excellence ones
of this village</font>

44
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:57,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and thought I'd put dibs on them.</font>

45
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:07,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A little while ago, I gave that
same Curse Mark as a present.</font>

46
00:02:09,350 --> 00:02:10,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a kid that I want.</font>

47
00:02:12,610 --> 00:02:14,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Selfish as always.</font>

48
00:02:14,610 --> 00:02:16,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kid will die.</font>

49
00:02:17,150 --> 00:02:17,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Certainly...</font>

50
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:20,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The odds are 1 in 10
that he'll survive,</font>

51
00:02:21,410 --> 00:02:25,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but he may survive just like you did.</font>

52
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:28,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This kid, you really like him, huh?</font>

53
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:31,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you jealous?</font>

54
00:02:32,130 --> 00:02:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you still holding a grudge that
I used you and threw you away?</font>

55
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:43,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlike you, that kid will excel...</font>

56
00:02:44,350 --> 00:02:48,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For one thing, he inherited
the Uchiha ability.</font>

57
00:02:50,140 --> 00:02:51,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has beautiful features</font>

58
00:02:51,940 --> 00:02:54,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and is a vessel who
can become my heir.</font>

59
00:02:55,190 --> 00:02:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that kid lived,
it makes things interesting.</font>

60
00:02:59,570 --> 00:03:03,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be sure not to cancel this test.</font>

61
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:08,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three from my village are also
under your care...</font>

62
00:03:08,910 --> 00:03:10,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Make me enjoy it.</font>

63
00:03:13,670 --> 00:03:17,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If something happens
to deprive me of my fun,</font>

64
00:03:18,380 --> 00:03:21,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">consider it the end of Leaf Village.</font>

65
00:03:39,740 --> 00:03:42,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've secured food and water
after spending half a day.</font>

66
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:46,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And now most teams have halted activity.</font>

67
00:03:47,910 --> 00:03:50,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As we planned,
this is the time that we attack.</font>

68
00:03:50,830 --> 00:03:53,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll split up into three
and go scouting.</font>

69
00:03:53,710 --> 00:03:57,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, whether we find
other teams or not,</font>

70
00:03:57,590 --> 00:03:59,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we return to this place.</font>

71
00:04:01,130 --> 00:04:01,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it?</font>

72
00:04:02,430 --> 00:04:04,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Okay.
— Roger.</font>

73
00:04:05,140 --> 00:04:06,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay. Scatter!</font>

74
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:19,190
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Super Eyebrow Platonic!</font>

75
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:19,190
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">I Will Protect You</font>

76
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:19,190
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">to the Death!!</font>

77
00:05:11,870 --> 00:05:13,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't fall asleep...</font>

78
00:05:16,250 --> 00:05:18,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I need to protect these two.</font>

79
00:05:30,390 --> 00:05:32,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I slept great!</font>

80
00:05:32,270 --> 00:05:33,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

81
00:05:35,770 --> 00:05:36,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

82
00:05:37,100 --> 00:05:39,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you take care of us?</font>

83
00:05:39,730 --> 00:05:41,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you, Sakura-chan!</font>

84
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:43,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're totally better because of you!</font>

85
00:05:45,900 --> 00:05:46,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's good...</font>

86
00:05:52,030 --> 00:05:57,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A prey must always stay tense
and flee desperately</font>

87
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in front of the predator!</font>

88
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:12,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My voice is gone!</font>

89
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:27,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was just a dream...</font>

90
00:06:32,990 --> 00:06:34,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it daybreak already?!</font>

91
00:06:36,790 --> 00:06:37,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, no way!</font>

92
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:53,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A squirrel?</font>

93
00:06:54,180 --> 00:06:57,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't surprise me like that!</font>

94
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:58,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

95
00:07:02,230 --> 00:07:03,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was too close.</font>

96
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:05,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you think she noticed?</font>

97
00:07:06,230 --> 00:07:08,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Paper Bomb we put on the squirrel...</font>

98
00:07:08,530 --> 00:07:10,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that's not it.</font>

99
00:07:10,820 --> 00:07:14,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Then what? What was it?</font>

100
00:07:14,580 --> 00:07:17,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll probably find out if we go closer.</font>

101
00:07:18,410 --> 00:07:21,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... we should get going now.</font>

102
00:07:40,940 --> 00:07:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I can catch all twenty of these leaves
before they hit the ground</font>

103
00:07:44,770 --> 00:07:48,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-san will start to like me.</font>

104
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:51,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If... if I can't catch
even one of the leaves...!</font>

105
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:55,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be an unanswered love forever.
Or rather...</font>

106
00:07:55,700 --> 00:07:57,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're too Bushy!</font>

107
00:07:57,580 --> 00:07:59,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what she'll say.</font>

108
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:03,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two, three, four...
five, six, seven, eight...</font>

109
00:08:03,870 --> 00:08:06,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">nine, ten, eleven, twelve, thirteen, fourteen,
fifteen, sixteen, seventeen, eighteen,</font>

110
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:10,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">nine...!
Ugh, nineteen...</font>

111
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:12,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One more!</font>

112
00:08:15,890 --> 00:08:16,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...!</font>

113
00:08:23,690 --> 00:08:25,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Phew... just in time.</font>

114
00:08:27,150 --> 00:08:30,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is called a Paper Bomb
and it explodes after some time.</font>

115
00:08:31,860 --> 00:08:33,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who did such an awful thing?</font>

116
00:08:41,750 --> 00:08:43,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop hiding and come out.</font>

117
00:08:44,670 --> 00:08:47,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap! We scrambled to hide, you know?!</font>

118
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:51,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, he's a damn pain
and we've been discovered!</font>

119
00:08:52,010 --> 00:08:55,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Strategy One, "hide and let it pass,"
was a failure!</font>

120
00:08:56,010 --> 00:08:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So now we carry out Strategy Two!</font>

121
00:08:58,850 --> 00:09:01,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Are you serious?</font>

122
00:09:01,850 --> 00:09:04,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? You have a problem with that?</font>

123
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:06,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no question of success.</font>

124
00:09:07,190 --> 00:09:09,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I guess it's all right but...</font>

125
00:09:10,650 --> 00:09:16,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow! To meet last year's Number One
rookie, Hyuga Neji-sama, in a place like this!</font>

126
00:09:16,910 --> 00:09:19,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C-Can I have your autograph?</font>

127
00:09:19,580 --> 00:09:21,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it's just you guys?</font>

128
00:09:21,740 --> 00:09:26,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take that! Strategy Two, "head over heals
infatuation with my sex appeal"!</font>

129
00:09:26,790 --> 00:09:32,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd been wanting to meet you
for some time, you know?</font>

130
00:09:32,550 --> 00:09:33,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get lost!</font>

131
00:09:36,340 --> 00:09:39,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why? Why doesn't my sexiness work?!</font>

132
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:43,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap, it ticks me off, damn!</font>

133
00:09:45,770 --> 00:09:50,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you just raise your fists to me,
and does that mean you want to fight?</font>

134
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No...
Of course not.</font>

135
00:09:55,820 --> 00:09:56,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then get lost.</font>

136
00:09:57,490 --> 00:10:00,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stealing a scroll from cowardly wimps
like you</font>

137
00:10:00,910 --> 00:10:03,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would only make me
the laughing stock of the village.</font>

138
00:10:03,370 --> 00:10:05,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes!</font>

139
00:10:06,250 --> 00:10:09,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh... Really just like cockroaches.</font>

140
00:10:14,670 --> 00:10:16,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I thought.</font>

141
00:10:16,630 --> 00:10:21,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A fellow like that wouldn't take
a scroll away from wimps like us</font>

142
00:10:21,260 --> 00:10:23,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">unless we were to turn on him.</font>

143
00:10:23,470 --> 00:10:26,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Let's go find some wimps!</font>

144
00:10:28,020 --> 00:10:31,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I've been saying
there's no one wimpier than us...</font>

145
00:10:43,490 --> 00:10:45,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So a no-sleep lookout?</font>

146
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:49,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's not necessary anymore.</font>

147
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:55,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wake Sasuke-kun up.
We want to battle with him.</font>

148
00:10:55,750 --> 00:10:57,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You bastards...</font>

149
00:11:00,510 --> 00:11:01,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you saying?</font>

150
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:03,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it you're after?</font>

151
00:11:03,890 --> 00:11:06,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know the one called Orochimaru
is calling the shots from the shadows!</font>

152
00:11:07,270 --> 00:11:08,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

153
00:11:08,770 --> 00:11:11,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that strange bruise on
the back of Sasuke-kun's neck?</font>

154
00:11:12,270 --> 00:11:14,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did this to Sasuke-kun.</font>

155
00:11:14,110 --> 00:11:15,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can you say you want to fight him?!</font>

156
00:11:16,610 --> 00:11:21,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder... what he has on his mind?</font>

157
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:26,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, I can't stay quiet
after hearing that.</font>

158
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:31,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will kill this girl,
I'll also kill this Sasuke character.</font>

159
00:11:36,130 --> 00:11:37,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Zaku.</font>

160
00:11:37,670 --> 00:11:39,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What is it?</font>

161
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:44,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's so cliché.</font>

162
00:11:44,890 --> 00:11:47,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the color of dirt
that's just been dug up.</font>

163
00:11:48,060 --> 00:11:51,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This grass, it doesn't grow in
a place like this, does it?</font>

164
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:52,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

165
00:11:53,020 --> 00:11:54,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know, with a trap...</font>

166
00:11:55,150 --> 00:11:58,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no point unless you
make it so it's not discovered.</font>

167
00:12:00,740 --> 00:12:02,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, how ridiculous!</font>

168
00:12:02,990 --> 00:12:07,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that Kunai knife was so the squirrel
wouldn't be caught in the trap?</font>

169
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:09,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We kill her now!</font>

170
00:12:13,670 --> 00:12:14,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A log?!</font>

171
00:12:14,790 --> 00:12:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A trap above too? Watch out!</font>

172
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:19,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just kidding.</font>

173
00:12:21,590 --> 00:12:22,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

174
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:25,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clearly you have no talent.</font>

175
00:12:25,970 --> 00:12:29,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Someone like you needs to
make more of an effort or else!</font>

176
00:12:31,140 --> 00:12:32,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Hurricanes!</font>

177
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:40,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! This guy...</font>

178
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:44,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you also should... make an effort!</font>

179
00:12:45,860 --> 00:12:47,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you?</font>

180
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:51,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the beautiful green beast
of Leaf Village, Rock Lee!</font>

181
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:06,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you here?</font>

182
00:13:06,890 --> 00:13:08,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will always appear...</font>

183
00:13:08,760 --> 00:13:12,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">whenever you're in trouble!</font>

184
00:13:14,730 --> 00:13:15,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or should I say...</font>

185
00:13:15,890 --> 00:13:19,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was really because of you,
now run along.</font>

186
00:13:26,070 --> 00:13:29,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But right now, I'm also
your enemy!</font>

187
00:13:30,280 --> 00:13:32,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did say this once before, didn't I?</font>

188
00:13:34,500 --> 00:13:36,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That I'll protect you until I die.</font>

189
00:13:39,750 --> 00:13:41,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please go out with me!</font>

190
00:13:41,710 --> 00:13:44,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll protect you until I die!</font>

191
00:13:46,010 --> 00:13:46,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

192
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:49,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-Thanks.</font>

193
00:13:50,180 --> 00:13:50,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

194
00:13:50,970 --> 00:13:54,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perfect! I did it!
Guy-sensei, that was perfect!</font>

195
00:13:58,020 --> 00:13:59,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess it can't be helped...</font>

196
00:14:00,110 --> 00:14:03,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zaku. I'll give you Sasuke-kun.</font>

197
00:14:05,110 --> 00:14:06,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will kill them!</font>

198
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:11,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As far as I can tell,
Sakura-san is in no condition to fight.</font>

199
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:16,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Bushy-Brow guy is
pretty proficient with Taijutsu...</font>

200
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:18,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like I can have some fun!</font>

201
00:14:27,630 --> 00:14:31,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is a trick to your attack, isn't there?</font>

202
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't just simply avoid it.</font>

203
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:36,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You showed me your Jutsu before.</font>

204
00:14:40,770 --> 00:14:42,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy... he's strong.</font>

205
00:14:43,230 --> 00:14:44,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Having said that,</font>

206
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:46,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the odds aren't good since
it's one versus three.</font>

207
00:14:46,610 --> 00:14:48,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna have to take a chance.</font>

208
00:14:52,030 --> 00:14:53,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One person at a time...</font>

209
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:54,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give it my all and take each down!</font>

210
00:15:05,250 --> 00:15:08,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no one at all that seems wimpy!</font>

211
00:15:08,550 --> 00:15:14,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, the only team that's weaker
than us is the Naruto team.</font>

212
00:15:14,050 --> 00:15:16,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot! You know what you're saying?</font>

213
00:15:16,390 --> 00:15:17,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

214
00:15:17,140 --> 00:15:19,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No question Naruto and Sakura are lame!</font>

215
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:22,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that team has
the super genius Sasuke-kun!</font>

216
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:24,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! I wonder...</font>

217
00:15:24,820 --> 00:15:28,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In actual battle that genius
might easily be beaten.</font>

218
00:15:28,900 --> 00:15:30,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

219
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:35,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, all right,
I apologize for irritating you.</font>

220
00:15:36,030 --> 00:15:38,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a pain...</font>

221
00:15:38,540 --> 00:15:43,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I say one negative thing about
Sasuke and I get the evil eye, every time...</font>

222
00:15:44,210 --> 00:15:46,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way Sasuke-kun
could be taken down!</font>

223
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:50,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura's a different matter though!</font>

224
00:15:54,390 --> 00:15:55,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

225
00:15:56,760 --> 00:15:58,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Sasuke has collapsed...</font>

226
00:15:58,930 --> 00:15:59,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

227
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:01,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...and Sakura is fighting.</font>

228
00:16:02,100 --> 00:16:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?</font>

229
00:16:08,570 --> 00:16:09,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

230
00:16:11,860 --> 00:16:13,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's late.</font>

231
00:16:13,990 --> 00:16:15,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Lee...</font>

232
00:16:15,990 --> 00:16:17,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something's not right.</font>

233
00:16:17,450 --> 00:16:20,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's always precise about time.</font>

234
00:16:21,330 --> 00:16:23,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps he ran into the enemy...</font>

235
00:16:24,920 --> 00:16:25,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be...?</font>

236
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:29,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, that wouldn't have happened.</font>

237
00:16:30,340 --> 00:16:32,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case, let's find Lee!</font>

238
00:16:33,010 --> 00:16:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

239
00:16:40,850 --> 00:16:44,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! I've finally mastered it!
Yes! Yes!</font>

240
00:16:44,690 --> 00:16:48,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My friends, there's no reason
to give up on your youth!</font>

241
00:16:56,570 --> 00:16:57,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Jutsu...</font>

242
00:16:57,910 --> 00:17:00,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the end, only Lee
could make it his own.</font>

243
00:17:01,250 --> 00:17:02,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yahoo!</font>

244
00:17:02,250 --> 00:17:04,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hey, Lee...
— I did it! I will do it!</font>

245
00:17:04,710 --> 00:17:06,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Lee!
— When I try! I try!</font>

246
00:17:06,460 --> 00:17:07,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Lee!</font>

247
00:17:09,670 --> 00:17:11,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

248
00:17:15,840 --> 00:17:19,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen to this passionate message
from your teacher!</font>

249
00:17:19,100 --> 00:17:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... what is it?!</font>

250
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:22,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please tell me using hip words.</font>

251
00:17:26,060 --> 00:17:27,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Jutsu, the "Lotus"...</font>

252
00:17:27,980 --> 00:17:30,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it will be dealt with henceforth
as a forbidden Jutsu.</font>

253
00:17:30,610 --> 00:17:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— Huh?!</font>

254
00:17:33,190 --> 00:17:34,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What do you mean?</font>

255
00:17:35,570 --> 00:17:39,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Jutsu poses a great burden
on the cells of the muscles,</font>

256
00:17:39,990 --> 00:17:42,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's a kind of "Self-sacrificing Technique."</font>

257
00:17:43,540 --> 00:17:47,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humans normally utilize,
at most, 20 percent...</font>

258
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:50,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of the "power" that the muscles have.</font>

259
00:17:50,460 --> 00:17:52,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you understand?
Only 20 percent!</font>

260
00:17:53,010 --> 00:17:55,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if nearly 100 percent
of the "power" is used</font>

261
00:17:55,550 --> 00:17:57,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the muscles themselves will disintegrate.</font>

262
00:17:58,220 --> 00:18:02,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, the brain usually controls the "power."</font>

263
00:18:03,310 --> 00:18:08,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, this Jutsu forces the
brain's limiter to go off by using Chakra,</font>

264
00:18:08,650 --> 00:18:12,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">allowing high speed continuous Taijutsu...</font>

265
00:18:12,570 --> 00:18:15,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, this is a dangerous Jutsu
which relies on a secret technique</font>

266
00:18:15,650 --> 00:18:19,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that brings forth "power" almost
to the limit of one's body.</font>

267
00:18:21,620 --> 00:18:24,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the only time it is all right
to use this Jutsu</font>

268
00:18:24,410 --> 00:18:26,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is when a certain condition is met...</font>

269
00:18:27,620 --> 00:18:30,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... when is that?</font>

270
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:32,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you ready?</font>

271
00:18:33,380 --> 00:18:34,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this to heart...</font>

272
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:37,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The condition is...</font>

273
00:18:41,010 --> 00:18:42,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The condition is...</font>

274
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:48,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei...</font>

275
00:18:49,350 --> 00:18:52,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will utilize that Jutsu without reserve.</font>

276
00:18:53,610 --> 00:18:55,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because this is the time you said..</font>

277
00:18:59,910 --> 00:19:02,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"When protecting a precious person!"</font>

278
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:05,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He disappeared?!</font>

279
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:11,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just the beginning.</font>

280
00:19:19,340 --> 00:19:20,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, oh no!</font>

281
00:19:20,550 --> 00:19:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way he can break his fall!</font>

282
00:19:23,510 --> 00:19:25,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

283
00:19:25,310 --> 00:19:26,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Primary Lotus!</font>

284
00:19:35,320 --> 00:19:36,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This feeling...</font>

285
00:19:38,990 --> 00:19:40,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well well...</font>

286
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:44,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just in time.</font>

287
00:19:53,830 --> 00:19:55,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-That's impossible!</font>

288
00:19:56,040 --> 00:19:58,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is a frightening Jutsu...</font>

289
00:19:58,710 --> 00:20:02,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It did this much even though
I fell on the spongy dirt.</font>

290
00:20:06,510 --> 00:20:09,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's now my turn.</font>

291
00:20:09,770 --> 00:20:11,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no! With what I just did...</font>

292
00:20:12,310 --> 00:20:13,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my body still isn't...</font>

293
00:20:17,980 --> 00:20:18,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee!</font>

294
00:20:25,320 --> 00:20:28,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your Jutsu is indeed fast.</font>

295
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:34,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But our Jutsu exceeds that
and is the speed of sound!</font>

296
00:20:39,500 --> 00:20:43,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll show you there are walls</font>

297
00:20:44,090 --> 00:20:45,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">which effort alone can
never break through.</font>

298
00:21:04,990 --> 00:21:09,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

299
00:21:04,990 --> 00:21:10,010
